lor=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>: </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uaxes/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>도끼</b></font><b><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">\n</font></b></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>| </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/ubows/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>보우</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> |</b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/ucrossbows/\"><b><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></b><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>크로스보우</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> | </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/udaggers/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>단검</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> |</b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/umaces/\"><b><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></b><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>메이스</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> | </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/upolearms/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>풀암</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><br></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uscepters/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>셉터</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> | </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uspears/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>스피어</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> | </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/ustaves/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>스태프</b></font><b><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></b></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>| </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uswords/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>스워드</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> | </b></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020202172343/http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/uthrowing.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>던지는 \n                무기</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> |</b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uwands/\"><b><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></b><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>완드</b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><b><font color=\"#996600\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Elite \nUniques</font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>: </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/euweapons/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>무기</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> | </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/euarmor/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>아머</b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"580\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"30\" width=\"562\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020202172343/http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/sets7.shtml#sandersfolly\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#996600\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;</b></font></a><font color=\"olive\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><b>Exceptional Unique Wands\n                             \n                            </b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>[익셉셔널 유니크 완드]</b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><img height=\"118\" src=\"/img/posts/site/Diablo/images/item/unique/wand.gif\" width=\"62\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#908858\"><span><b>Suicide \nBranch</b></span></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><span>Burnt Wand</span></span></font></p></center></td>\n<td bgcolor=\"white\" width=\"219\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>One-Hand Damage: 8 To 18 (13 \nAvg)<br>Required Level: 33<br>Required Strength: 25<br>Durability: 15<br>Base \nWeapon Speed: [0]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">150% Damage To Undead</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+1 To All Skills</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">50% Faster Cast \nRate</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Increase Maximum Mana 10%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">All Resistances +10</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+40 To \nLife</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Attacker Takes Damage of 25</font><br>(Only \nSpawns In Patch 1.09 or later) </span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"214\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>한손 \n                            데미지 : 8 To 18 (13 \nAvg)<br>레벨 요구치 : 33<br>힘 요구치 : 25<br>내구력 : 15<br>무기기본속도 : [0]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">150% 언데드계열에 대해 데미지 추가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+1 모든 스킬</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">50% 매우빠른 캐스팅 속도 </font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">최대 마나 10% 증가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">모든 저항력 +10</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+40 라이프</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">공격자가 받는 데미지 25</font><br>(Only \nSpawns In Patch 1.09 or later) </span></font> </p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><img height=\"118\" src=\"/img/posts/site/Diablo/images/item/unique/maelstromwrath.gif\" width=\"62\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#908858\"><span><b>Carin \nShard</b></span></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><span>Petrified Wand</span></span></font></p></center></td>\n<td bgcolor=\"white\" width=\"219\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>One-Hand Damage: 8 To 24 (16 \nAvg)<br>Required Level: 35<br>Required Strength: 25<br>Durability: 15<br>Base \nWeapon Speed: [10]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">150% Damage To Undead</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+ (1.25 Per Character Level) 1.25-123.75 To Mana (Based On \nCharacter Level)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+ (1.25 Per Character Level) \n1.25-123.75 To Life (Based On Character Level)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+1 \nTo Necromancer Skill Levels</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+2 To Summoning Skills \n(Necromancer Only)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">10% Faster Cast \nRate</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">30% Faster Hit Recovery</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Replenish Life +5</font><br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) \n</span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"214\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>한손 \n                            데미지 : 8 To 24 (16 \nAvg)<br>레벨 요구치 : 35<br>힘 요구치 : 25<br>내구력 : 15<br>무기기본속도 : [10]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">150%언데드 계열에 대해 데미지 추가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+ (캐릭터레벨 1.25마다) 1.25-123.75 마나 추가 (캐릭터레벨에 비례해서)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+ (캐릭터 레벨 1.25마다) \n1.25-123.75 라이프 추가(캐릭터레벨에 비례해서)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+1 네크로멘서 스킬</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+2 소환스킬 \n(네크로멘서 전용)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">10% 매우 빠른 캐스팅 속도</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">30% 매우 빠른 회복 속도</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">라이프 회복력  +5</font><br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) \n</span></font> </p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><img height=\"118\" src=\"/img/posts/site/Diablo/images/item/unique/gravenspine.gif\" width=\"62\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#908858\"><span><b>Arm Of King \nLeoric</b></span></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><span>Tomb Wand</span></span></font></p></center></td>\n<td bgcolor=\"white\" width=\"219\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>One-Hand Damage: 10 To 22 (16 \nAvg)<br>Required Level: 36<br>Required Strength: 25<br>Durability: 15<br>Base \nWeapon Speed: [-20]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">150% Damage To Undead</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">10% Chance To Cast Level 2 Bone Prison When Struck</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">5% Chance To Cast Level 10 Bone Spirit When Struck</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+ (1.25 Per Character Level) 1.25-123.75 To Mana (Based On \nCharacter Level)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">10% Faster Cast \nRate</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+2 To Terror (Necromancer \nOnly)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+2 To Raise Skeletal Mage (Necromancer \nOnly)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+3 To Skeleton Mastery </font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvet